# Derived art (BUILD-PLAN.md section 8: do not commit derived files).
# This applies to art/parts/ once source sheets live in art/sheets/.
#
# IMPORTANT: art-tools/dracula_parts/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The
# source parts sheets are not in this repo, so those 41 layers plus their
# parts.json are the only copy of that art -- they are not regenerable
# here. The _contact_sheet.png files stay too: every "label" in parts.json
# is still empty, so the contact sheets are currently the only
# index -> body-part map, which Phase 5 rigging needs.
art/parts/

